## Commercial Use Registration

Commercial use of the Software is permitted free of charge, provided that, prior to such commercial use, the person or entity making such commercial use submits a Commercial Use Registration to:

https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSff5QjjANlJ2hnXYqBSAzKWxEM58gIxPLh17-t3j3-MqO1a5w/viewform
The registration must include:

- the name and repository URL of the software or code project being registered;
- the name of the individual, company, institution, or organization making the commercial use;
- a valid contact name and email address;
- the name of the product, service, or project in which the Software will be used; and
- a brief description of how the Software will be used.

Upon submission of a complete and accurate Commercial Use Registration, permission for such commercial use is automatically granted. No approval, response, registration fee, or license fee from the copyright holder is required.

A new registration is required only when the Software is used in a materially different product, service, or project. Updates or new versions of the same registered product, service, or project do not require additional registration.

For purposes of this License, "commercial use" means use of the Software as part of, or in connection with, a product, service, or project that is offered for sale, licensing, subscription, or other commercial consideration.

Use of the Software for research, education, evaluation, personal use, or internal research and development, including such use by commercial organizations, does not require registration, provided that the Software is not incorporated into or used to provide a commercial product or service.

